WEBVTT

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:04.550
Two desktop shortcuts can make your
workspace easier

00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:08.250
to explore. First, click outside any text
input.

00:00:08.710 --> 00:00:11.230
Press question mark to open Keyboard
Shortcuts.

00:00:11.930 --> 00:00:16.150
Find A for ARIA and P for Portfolio.

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:19.670
Press Escape to close help, then press A.

00:00:20.110 --> 00:00:22.330
ARIA opens so you can inspect its
conditions.

00:00:23.170 --> 00:00:25.350
Press P to switch to Portfolio.

00:00:25.990 --> 00:00:27.330
The keys change your view.

00:00:27.930 --> 00:00:29.430
They do not replace your review.

00:00:29.430 --> 00:00:31.930
Try both shortcuts at your own pace.

00:00:32.770 --> 00:00:36.050
On a phone, use the visible navigation
tabs instead.

